{#
  BeMart admin ClassName list — EC-CUBE goClassNameList (規格管理).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Product/class_name.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Product/class_name.twig).

  Product section, LIST + inline-FORM page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`). The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` /
  Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the ClassNameList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/ClassName/ClassNameList.php — body carries
  `classNames` (a list of {classNameId, name}), `count` and an
  AdminClassNameForm exposed as `form`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-url route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`.
   - `form_widget(form.name)` / `form.backend_name` ->
     `form.input('name')` / `form.input('backend_name')` — the real
     AdminClassNameForm inline-create inputs (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget; the
     hidden `_token` input is kept with an empty value (residual).
   - `{% for ClassName in ClassNames %}` -> the body's `classNames` list.
   - `ClassName.id` / `ClassName.name` -> the BeMart projection keys
     `classNameId` / `name`.
   - `ClassName.backend_name` -> the AdminClassNameListFetched projection
     does NOT carry the backend (管理名) column (Wave 7 shallow-list
     slice). The list-row backend label renders empty. FLAGGED for
     enrichment follow-up.
   - `ClassName.sortNo` -> dtb_class_name has the column but
     ClassNameEntity does not project it (storage-internal sort_no — see
     FakeClassNameStorage). `data-sort-no` renders empty. FLAGGED.
   - `ClassName.ClassCategories|length` -> the projection does not carry
     the child-class-category COUNT; the `({n})` suffix and the
     delete-disabled branch render with 0. FLAGGED for enrichment
     follow-up.
   - per-row `forms[ClassName.id]` inline-EDIT form -> the per-row edit
     is `doUpdateClassName` at a sibling resource; the list resource
     carries no per-row form. The `mode-edit` collapse panel keeps
     EC-CUBE's structure but renders plain `<input>`s repopulated from
     the row. Enumerated as residual.
   - the entity-extension `auto_render` loop -> EC-CUBE-runtime; dropped.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE
     per-request CSRF widget; OMITTED.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-class-name-class-name-list' %}
{% set title = '規格管理' %}
{% set sub_title = '商品管理' %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style type="text/css">
        .list-group-item:hover {
            z-index: inherit;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock stylesheet %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $(function() {
            var oldSortNos = [];
            // 画面の中のsortNo一覧を保持
            $('.sortable-item').each(function() {
                oldSortNos.push(this.dataset.sortNo);
            });
            // rsort
            oldSortNos.sort(function(a, b) {
                return a - b;
            }).reverse();

            $('.sortable-container').sortable({
                items: '> .sortable-item',
                cursor: 'move',
                update: function(e, ui) {
                    $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
                    updateSortNo();
                }
            });

            var updateSortNo = function() {
                // 並び替え後にsortNoを更新
                var newSortNos = {};
                var i = 0;
                $('.sortable-item').each(function() {
                    newSortNos[this.dataset.classNameId] = oldSortNos[i];
                    i++;
                });

                $.ajax({
                    url: '/admin/sort-no-move?masterType=className&_method=put',
                    type: 'POST',
                    data: newSortNos
                }).done(function() {
                    // remove class disable
                    $('a.up.disabled').removeClass('disabled');
                    $('a.down.disabled').removeClass('disabled');
                    // First element
                    $('.sortable-item > li:nth-child(2) > div > div.col-auto.text-end > a.up').addClass('disabled');
                }).always(function() {
                    redrawDisableAllows();
                    $('.modal-backdrop').remove();
                });
            };

            // 最初と最後の↑↓を再描画
            var redrawDisableAllows = function() {
                var items = $('.sortable-item');
                items.find('a.up').removeClass('disabled');
                items.find('a.down').removeClass('disabled');
                items.first().find('a.up').addClass('disabled');
                items.last().find('a.down').addClass('disabled');
            };

            $('.sortable-item a.up').click(function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('.list-group-item');
                current.prev().before(current);
                $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
                updateSortNo();
            });

            $('.sortable-item a.down').click(function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('.list-group-item');
                current.next().after(current);
                $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
                updateSortNo();
            });

            // 編集
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'a.action-edit', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });
            // 編集キャンセル
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'button.action-edit-cancel', function(e) {
                location.href = '/admin/class-name/class-name-list';
            });

            // 編集時, エラーがあれば入力欄を表示.
            $('.sortable-item').find('.is-invalid').each(function(e) {
                var current = $(this).parents('li');
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });

            // 削除モーダルのhrefとmessageの変更
            $('#DeleteModal').on('shown.bs.modal', function(event) {
                var target = $(event.relatedTarget);
                // hrefの変更
                $(this).find('[data-post-action="delete"]').attr('href', target.data('url'));

                // messageの変更
                $(this).find('p.modal-message').text(target.data('message'));
            });
        });
    </script>

{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-outsideBlock">
        <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents mb-2">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12 text-right">
                    <div class="btn-group" role="group">
                        <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="/admin/class-name/class-name-export">
                            <i class="fa fa-cloud-download mr-1 text-secondary"></i>
                            <span>CSVダウンロード</span>
                        </a>
                        <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="/admin/csv-config">
                            <i class="fa fa-cog mr-1 text-secondary"></i>
                            <span>CSV出力項目設定</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        <div class="card rounded border-0">
                            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush sortable-container">
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <form role="form" class="row" name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="/admin/class-name/class-name-list" data-alps="doCreateClassName">
                                        <div class="col-auto align-self-center">
                                            <span>規格名</span>
                                            <span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-3 me-2">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                                            {{ form.input('classNameLabel')|raw }}
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-auto align-self-center" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="管理者用に別名を登録しておくことができます（例：規格名：サイズ　管理名：サイズ（服）、サイズ（靴）等 ）。フロント画面には表示されません。">
                                            <span>管理名</span>
                                            <i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-3">
                                            <input type="text" id="admin_class_name_backend_name" class="form-control" value="" disabled>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-auto">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-regular" type="submit">新規作成</button>
                                        </div>
                                    </form>
                                </li>
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <div class="row">
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>ID</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-1"><strong>規格管理</strong></div>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                {% for ClassName in classNames %}
                                    <li id="ex-class_name-{{ ClassName.classNameId }}" class="list-group-item sortable-item" data-class-name-id="{{ ClassName.classNameId }}" data-sort-no="">
                                        <div class="row justify-content-around mode-view">
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center"><i class="fa fa-bars text-ec-gray"></i></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center">{{ ClassName.classNameId }}</div>
                                            <div class="col d-flex align-items-center">
                                                <a href="/admin/class-category/class-category-list?classNameId={{ ClassName.classNameId }}">{{ ClassName.name }}［管理名：］ (0)</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto text-end">
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 up {% if loop.first %}disabled{% endif %}" href="" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="上へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-up fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 down {% if loop.last %}disabled{% endif %}" href="" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="下へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-down fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-edit" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="編集">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-pencil fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <div class="d-inline-block me-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                                                     data-bs-placement="top" title="削除">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon"
                                                       data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#DeleteModal"
                                                       data-url="/admin/class-name/class-name?classNameId={{ ClassName.classNameId }}&_method=delete"
                                                       data-message="この操作はあとから取り消すことができません。「{{ ClassName.name }}」を削除してよろしいですか？"
                                                       data-alps="doDeleteClassName">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <form class="row d-none mode-edit" method="post" action="/admin/class-name/class-name?classNameId={{ ClassName.classNameId|url_encode }}&_method=put" data-alps="doUpdateClassName">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                                            <div class="col-auto align-self-center"><span>規格名</span></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="classNameLabel" value="{{ ClassName.name }}" data-origin-value="{{ ClassName.name }}">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-self-center"><span>管理名</span></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" value="" data-origin-value="" disabled>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion" type="submit">決定</button>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-sub action-edit-cancel" type="button">キャンセル</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </form>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            <!-- 削除モーダル -->
                            <div class="modal fade" id="DeleteModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog"
                                 aria-labelledby="DeleteModal" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                    <div class="modal-content">
                                        <div class="modal-header">
                                            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                削除します
                                            </h5>
                                            <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">

                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                            <p class="text-start modal-message"><!-- jsでメッセージを挿入 --></p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-footer">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                                                キャンセル
                                            </button>
                                            <a class="btn btn-ec-delete" href="#"
                                               data-confirm="false">
                                                削除
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>項目の順番はドラッグ＆ドロップでも変更可能です。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
